From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Brooks <bass_rock@me.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:34:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] radv: report dynamicPrimitiveTopologyUnrestricted, which its
 draws already honour

Each draw computes the primitive it outputs from the dynamic topology
(radv_get_vgt_outprim_type), and NGG shaders take the vertices of a
primitive from user SGPRs, so one pipeline draws every topology class.
Stela's Metal device creates a pipeline of no stated class with a
triangle topology and draws points and lines with it.
---
 src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c
index 9331137c1bbeda7fa7a39d6b0da568e8efa63aeb..f623cb04397dd740b37fee57d33439483718ab48 100644
--- a/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/amd/vulkan/radv_physical_device.c
@@ -2270,7 +2270,12 @@ radv_get_physical_device_properties(struct radv_physical_device *pdev)
       .prefersCompactPrimitiveOutput = false,
 
       /* VK_EXT_extended_dynamic_state3 */
-      .dynamicPrimitiveTopologyUnrestricted = false,
+      /* Every draw derives its output primitive from the dynamic topology
+       * (radv_get_vgt_outprim_type), and NGG reads the vertices per
+       * primitive from user SGPRs, so a pipeline draws any topology class.
+       * Stela's Metal device draws points and lines with a pipeline whose
+       * class Metal left unspecified. */
+      .dynamicPrimitiveTopologyUnrestricted = true,
 
       /* VK_EXT_descriptor_buffer */
       .combinedImageSamplerDescriptorSingleArray = true,
